WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a Turtle Lab project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → Turtle Lab.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.800
Step 2: Type commands and press Run. fd 100 goes forward 100 steps; rt 90 turns right.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.400
Step 3: Repeat to make shapes. repeat 4 [fd 150 rt 90] draws a square. A repeat inside a repeat makes a pattern.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.800
Step 4: Find ideas in Commands and Examples. Every command explained, and examples to load and run.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.800
Step 5: Slow the turtle down. The Speed slider shows each move, or draws at once.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.200
Step 6: Teach it your own command. to star :size … end, then star 150.
